    "created_at": "2019-03-30T20:57:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-30T20:57:50Z",
    "body": "> How can you add site specific quirk for such a widely used library?\r\n\r\nBy \"site specific quirk\", I don't mean to base quirk based on an URL but rather the pattern of usage that indicates that particular version of YUI. For example, WebKit used to have a quirk which got enabled based on file name from which CSS selector came from, etc... to detect some versions of media wiki for which a quirk was needed.",
